igest":"sha256:0301a9a73431f9bef96f1d0c70e7e2961be21711d5b7462dc3703e80700be367","downloadCount":1,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nbB5X","label":"","name":"up-term-src.lha","size":111817016,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T04:57:30Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.3/up-term-src.lha"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/spotUP/vtcon/releases/assets/661397095","contentType":"application/x-lzh-compressed","createdAt":"2026-10-21T04:56:57Z","digest":"sha256:dd63dc227fa89b253a73ae92feb5590c957eea2f48f44e655fd24f80f071778d","downloadCount":1,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nbB5n","label":"","name":"up-term.lha","size":27690984,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T04:57:15Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.3/up-term.lha"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/spotUP/vtcon/releases/assets/661397504","contentType":"application/vnd.shana.informed.package","createdAt":"2026-10-21T04:57:11Z","digest":"sha256:866c34f70e699232fbc6d4eef268b9dce2ed6a456059b985502cfa2959c32f58","downloadCount":1,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nbCAA","label":"","name":"up-vim_1.0_m68k-amigaos.ipk","size":3592750,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T04:57:13Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.3/up-vim_1.0_m68k-amigaos.ipk"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/spotUP/vtcon/releases/assets/661396979","contentType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","createdAt":"2026-10-21T04:56:55Z","digest":"sha256:b45de3edc7d9872b571f376ee4f0aa573899535d0fd40b14e807b8e3708ca863","downloadCount":1,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nbB3z","label":"","name":"upkg-index.txt","size":622,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T04:56:55Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.3/upkg-index.txt"}],"body":"UP-Term 1.3: base kit plus the upkg add-on feed.\n\n- up-term.lha installs the base, including the upkg package manager. upkg itself is not in any ipk: get it (and upgrades of it) through the base Install from up-term.lha.\n- Add-ons are ipk packages in this release's feed (Packages, Packages.gz): up-claude 1.1; up-pi, up-nvim, up-python, up-git, up-perl and up-vim 1.0. Run `upkg update`, then `upkg install <name>`.\n- Fixed: installs no longer warn \"Can't create '/T'\"; an add-on whose Uninstall record is missing now warns and continues on removal; a failed upgrade is recovered.\n- The .lha archives for up-claude, up-pi, up-nvim and up-python stay available for installing without upkg.\n\nBuilt from spotUP/UP-Term 1eeeae4b, upterm b8f50ee (see VERSIONS in the kit).\n","createdAt":"2026-10-19T10:56:28Z","name":"UP-Term 1.3","tagName":"v1.3","targetCommitish":"main"}
